<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>营养师 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E8%90%A5%E5%85%BB%E5%B8%88/</link><description>Recent content in 营养师 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E8%90%A5%E5%85%BB%E5%B8%88/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>营养与饮食：看营养师、减重计划、食物过敏与忌口、外食怎么选</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/nutrition-and-diet/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/nutrition-and-diet/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在美国管营养的正规头衔是 &lt;strong&gt;registered dietitian（RD / RDN，注册营养师）&lt;/strong&gt;：要学位、要临床实习、要执照考试。&lt;code&gt;nutritionist&lt;/code&gt;（&amp;ldquo;营养师&amp;rdquo;）在很多州没有统一门槛，谁都能这么叫。所以找人之前问一句 &lt;code&gt;Are you a registered dietitian?&lt;/code&gt; 是最省事的筛子——没人会觉得被冒犯，营养师自己也会先说明。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>